text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M02_Text_08186027 {
    "Listen, kid, are you working\non a POKéDEX?\pHmm... Go to the SAFARI ZONE.\nThat’s my suggestion."
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M02_Text_08186086 {
    "Have you done anything at the\nRECORD CORNER?\pIt’s pretty neat. It mixes and matches\nthe records of TRAINERS.\pI don’t know quite how it works,\nbut it’s cool. It’s exciting, even!"
}

text Naranja_IslaShamouti_G12_M02_Text_08186138 {
    "Hey, you’ve got a POKéNAV!\nIt’s the same as mine.\pCheck out the TRAINER’S EYES on it.\pIt shows you TRAINERS who want a\nrematch with you.\pIsn’t it great?\nYou have to hand it to DEVON!"
}
